kelixip (0.2.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * First deb release (design P10), from the same staged payload as the RPM:
    core + kelixip-mod-registrar + kelixip-mod-auth-db, systemd unit with a
    graceful-shutdown ExecStop, per-host distribution cookie generated by
    postinst, root-owned module_dir.
  * /etc/default/kelixip is the environment file (the RPM uses
    /etc/sysconfig/kelixip); the unit and rel/env.sh read either.

